<title>INDIA: Indian July foodgrains stocks 25.27 mln tonnes.</title>
<headline>Indian July foodgrains stocks 25.27 mln tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>India had foodgrains stocks of 25.27 million tonnes in July compared to 34.01 million tonnes in July 1995, the government said on Thursday.</p>
<p>    FOODGRAINS STOCKS    Jul 96	Jul 95</p>
<p>    Rice		     11,890	15,450</p>
<p>    Wheat		    13,380	18,560</p>
<p>    Total		    25,270	34,010</p>
<p>Note - Figures are in thousands of tonnes and preliminary. Stocks of coarse grains are included in the totals but not broken out separately.</p>
</text>
